1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,940
You just became a hundred times

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:02,561
stronger.

3
00:00:03,021 --> 00:00:04,201
You could lift a car over

4
00:00:04,241 --> 00:00:04,601
your head.

5
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:06,982
But your spine didn't get stronger.

6
00:00:07,682 --> 00:00:09,282
The car's weight would crush it.

7
00:00:09,802 --> 00:00:11,023
Your tendons didn't either.

8
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:13,103
Your muscles would rip them right

9
00:00:13,143 --> 00:00:13,883
off your bones.

10
00:00:14,483 --> 00:00:15,684
Say your body could take it.

11
00:00:16,364 --> 00:00:18,164
Your grip squeezes with about four

12
00:00:18,244 --> 00:00:18,644
tonnes.

13
00:00:19,305 --> 00:00:21,105
One handshake crushes a hand.

14
00:00:21,605 --> 00:00:23,025
Opening a door rips it off

15
00:00:23,085 --> 00:00:23,626
