18
00:00:27,146 --> 00:00:28,947
Shoes can't grip any harder.

19
00:00:29,467 --> 00:00:29,767
Jump,

20
00:00:29,987 --> 00:00:31,607
and you'd fly about forty metres

21
00:00:31,748 --> 00:00:31,848
up...

22
00:00:32,228 --> 00:00:33,788
then land at nearly a hundred

23
00:00:33,828 --> 00:00:34,808
kilometres an hour.

24
00:00:35,328 --> 00:00:36,449
So you take a deep breath...

25
00:00:37,009 --> 00:00:39,209
and very gently lift the car.

